Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 1; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nPlanetary Scale Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nMainnet Alpha Planetary-Scale Edge Compute. The bedrock architecture for running, validating, and expanding trustless applications with absolute fault tolerance across decentralized regions. Network Synced 420+ Active R…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Planetary-Scale Edge Compute..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #030712, secondary #18181B, accent #030712, background #030712, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Planetary-Scale Edge Compute</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030712] text-slate-200 font-sans antialiased min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-indigo-200\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient Background / Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"telemetryCanvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 block pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Vignette Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 20%, #030712 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- HUD Overlay Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 xl:p-12 gap-10\">\n\n        <!-- Top Layer: Header & Controls -->\n        <header class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-6 w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto\">\n\n            <!-- Left: Hero Information Panel -->\n            <div class=\"w-full lg:max-w-md xl:max-w-lg p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/30 border border-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl\">\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" width=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-medium\">Mainnet Alpha</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"mt-8 text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.15]\">\n                    Planetary-Scale <br> Edge Compute.\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"mt-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                    The bedrock architecture for running, validating, and expanding trustless applications with absolute fault tolerance across decentralized regions.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right: Status & Action Bar -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 self-start\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/30 border border-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg\">\n                    <div class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                        <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-indigo-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-indigo-500\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium tracking-wide\">Network Synced</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2 p-1 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/30 border border-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg\">\n                    <button id=\"playbackToggle\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-transparent flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-all cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Toggle Animation\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-linear\" width=\"20\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-transparent flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-all cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Settings\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"20\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Spacer -->\n        <div class=\"flex-grow\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Layer: Metrics Dock -->\n        <footer class=\"w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 bg-slate-900/30 border border-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl overflow-hidden divide-y lg:divide-y-0 lg:divide-x divide-white/[0.06] shadow-2xl\">\n\n                <!-- Metric 1 -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-light text-white tracking-tight\">420+</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-linear\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-indigo-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Active Regions\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Metric 2 -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-light text-white tracking-tight\">$12.8T</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wallet-linear\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-indigo-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Value Secured\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Metric 3 -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-light text-white tracking-tight\">100%</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-indigo-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Consensus Uptime\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Metric 4 -->\n                <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-light text-white tracking-tight\">2.1B+</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-indigo-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Daily TXNs\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('telemetryCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n        let width, height;\n        let dataStreams = [];\n        let isAnimating = true;\n        let reqFrameId;\n\n        function handleResize() {\n            width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = window.innerHeight;\n            canvas.width = width * window.devicePixelRatio;\n            canvas.height = height * window.devicePixelRatio;\n            ctx.scale(window.devicePixelRatio, window.devicePixelRatio);\n            initializeStreams();\n        }\n\n        class DataStream {\n            constructor() {\n                this.reset(true);\n            }\n\n            reset(initial = false) {\n                // Shifted to a vertical top-down flow for immersive backdrop\n                this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                this.y = initial ? Math.random() * height : -150;\n                this.speed = 1.5 + Math.random() * 4.0;\n                this.length = 40 + Math.random() * 200;\n                this.opacity = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1;\n                this.thickness = 0.5 + Math.random() * 2.0;\n\n                // Color palette shifted to Indigo/Violet for new aesthetic\n                this.hue = 230 + Math.random() * 40;\n                this.lightness = 55 + Math.random() * 20;\n            }\n\n            update() {\n                this.y += this.speed;\n                if (this.y - this.length > height) {\n                    this.reset();\n                }\n            }\n\n            render() {\n                const headColor = `hsla(${this.hue}, 80%, ${this.lightness}%, ${this.opacity})`;\n                const tailColor = `hsla(${this.hue}, 80%, ${this.lightness}%, 0)`;\n\n                // Draw trail (vertical)\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(this.x, this.y - this.length, this.x, this.y);\n                gradient.addColorStop(0, tailColor);\n                gradient.addColorStop(1, headColor);\n\n                ctx.moveTo(this.x, this.y - this.length);\n                ctx.lineTo(this.x, this.y);\n                ctx.strokeStyle = gradient;\n                ctx.lineWidth = this.thickness;\n                ctx.stroke();\n\n                // Draw leading node\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.thickness * 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fillStyle = `hsla(${this.hue}, 100%, ${this.lightness + 20}%, ${this.opacity * 1.5})`;\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initializeStreams() {\n            dataStreams = [];\n            const streamCount = window.innerWidth < 1024 ? 80 : 180;\n            for(let i = 0; i < streamCount; i++) {\n                dataStreams.push(new DataStream());\n            }\n        }\n\n        function processFrame() {\n            if (!isAnimating) return;\n\n            // Subtle fade matching the #030712 background\n            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.25)';\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            dataStreams.forEach(stream => {\n                stream.update();\n                stream.render();\n            });\n\n            reqFrameId = requestAnimationFrame(processFrame);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            cancelAnimationFrame(reqFrameId);\n            handleResize();\n            if(isAnimating) {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n                processFrame();\n            }\n        });\n\n        // Init\n        handleResize();\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n        processFrame();\n\n        // Controls\n        const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('playbackToggle');\n        toggleBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n            isAnimating = !isAnimating;\n            if (isAnimating) {\n                toggleBtn.innerHTML = '<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-linear\" width=\"20\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>';\n                processFrame();\n            } else {\n                toggleBtn.innerHTML = '<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" width=\"20\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>';\n                cancelAnimationFrame(reqFrameId);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "planetary-scale-edge-compute.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/planetary-scale-edge-compute.jpg", "source_name": "planetary-scale-edge-compute-DESIGN.md", "views": 72, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-28T03:55:56.259044+00:00"}